<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-1153] Parquet-thrift doesn&apos;t compile with Thrift 0.10.0</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-1153</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Parquet-thrift doesn&apos;t compile with Thrift 0.10.0 due to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/THRIFT-2263&quot; title=&quot;Always generate good hashCode for Java&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;THRIFT-2263&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;THRIFT-2263&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. The default generator parameter used for &lt;tt&gt;--gen&lt;/tt&gt; argument by Thrift Maven plugin is no longer supported, this can be fixed with an additional &lt;tt&gt;&amp;lt;generator&amp;gt;java&amp;lt;/generator&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt; parameter to Thrift Maven plugin.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13115573">PARQUET-1153</key>
            <summary>Parquet-thrift doesn&apos;t compile with Thrift 0.10.0</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
                                            <priority id="3" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/priorities/major.svg">Major</priority>
                        <status id="5" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/statuses/resolved.png" description="A resolution has been taken, and it is awaiting verification by reporter. From here issues are either reopened, or are closed.">Resolved</status>
                    <statusCategory id="3" key="done" colorName="green"/>
                                    <resolution id="1">Fixed</resolution>
                                        <assignee username="nkollar">N&#225;ndor Koll&#225;r</assignee>
                                    <reporter username="nkollar">N&#225;ndor Koll&#225;r</reporter>
                        <labels>
                    </labels>
                <created>Thu, 2 Nov 2017 09:23:57 +0000</created>
                <updated>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:29:52 +0000</updated>
                            <resolved>Thu, 9 Nov 2017 16:18:39 +0000</resolved>
                                                    <fixVersion>1.10.0</fixVersion>
                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>4</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16237331" author="nkollar" created="Fri, 3 Nov 2017 09:07:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I think we should replace &lt;a href=&quot;https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.thrift.tools/maven-thrift-plugin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;maven-thrift-plugin&lt;/a&gt; to the one shipped with Thrift: &lt;a href=&quot;https://mvnrepository.com/artifact/org.apache.thrift/thrift-maven-plugin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;thrift-maven-plugin&lt;/a&gt; with the corresponding Thrift version. Looks like the the plugin used by Parquet now is merged to Thrift repository, thus the original is not maintained any more. Unfortunately this upgrade means that Thrift versions older than 0.9.3 are no longer compatible, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=julienledem&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;julienledem&quot;&gt;julienledem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=rdblue&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;rdblue&quot;&gt;rdblue&lt;/a&gt; can we drop support for older Thrift version in next Parquet release? 0.9.3 is already 2 years old.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16237795" author="rdblue" created="Fri, 3 Nov 2017 15:52:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I&apos;m not the best person to ask about thrift. I&apos;m fine with the proposed changes, but I&apos;m also not sure what the compatibility implications are. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alexlevenson&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alexlevenson&quot;&gt;alexlevenson&lt;/a&gt;, do you have an opinion here?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16245939" author="zi" created="Thu, 9 Nov 2017 16:18:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Issue resolved by pull request 434&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/434&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/434&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17858111" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:29:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/2102&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #2102&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
